<template name="privacy-consent"><view wx:if="{{privacyVisible}}" class="privacy-consent-overlay"><view class="privacy-consent-dialog"><text class="privacy-consent-title">启用账号服务前请确认</text><text class="privacy-consent-copy">请阅读{{privacyName}}。{{privacyDescription || '同意后将连接当前微信账号，读取服务状态、制作次数及作品；本次不会上传照片、制作或购买。人脸处理需在创作页单独授权。'}}</text><button class="privacy-consent-read" bindtap="readNativePrivacy">阅读隐私指引</button><button id="agree-native-privacy" open-type="agreePrivacyAuthorization" REDACTED_SECRET"agreeNativePrivacy">同意并继续</button><button class="privacy-consent-decline" bindtap="declineNativePrivacy">暂不同意，继续浏览</button></view></view></template>
